              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಭಿನ್ನಾಭಿಪ್ರಾಯ — bhinnābhiprāya — \"a difference of opinion\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಣ್ಣ ತಮ್ಮನ ನಡುವೆ ಸಣ್ಣ ಭಿನ್ನಾಭಿಪ್ರಾಯ ಇತ್ತು. aṇṇa tammana naḍuve saṇṇa bhinnābhiprāya ittu. There was a small difference of opinion between the brothers."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಭಿನ್ನ, different, + ಅಭಿಪ್ರಾಯ, opinion; the two vowels merge into ಆ."
            }
          ]
        },
